OL,3,GNEWSADiver urges more protection for
OL,4,Aworld's longest chalk reef
OL,5,
OL,6,FA diver who helped discover the
OL,7,Fsprawling size of the world's longest
OL,8,Fchalk reef has warned more needs to be
OL,9,Fdone to protect it, 10 years after it
OL,10,Fwas designated a Marine Conservation
OL,11,FZone (MCZ).
OL,13,FThe Cromer Shoal Chalk Beds, dubbed
OL,14,FGreat Britain's Barrier Reef, external,
OL,15,Fdate back more than 100 million years
OL,16,Fand stretch 20 miles (32km) along the
OL,17,FNorfolk coast from Happisburgh to
OL,18,FWeybourne.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
