OL,3,GNEWSADiver urges more protection for
OL,4,Aworld's longest chalk reef
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut diver Rob Spray, who uncovered the
OL,7,Freef's size with Dawn Watson, said the
OL,8,F"conservation zone has brought nothing
OL,9,Fin the way of protection".
OL,11,FNatural England, which granted the MCZ
OL,12,Fstatus, said it "remains committed to
OL,13,Fsafeguarding this remarkable habitat".
